"segments": [
{
"start": 0.94,
"end": 5.2,
"text": " It was supposed to be a family outing, but the press were out in force."
},
{
"start": 6.2,
"end": 8.16,
"text": "Somebody had helpfully tipped them off."
},
{
"start": 12.66,
"end": 21.17,
"text": "Michael was here to see the gorillas, but he seemed completely oblivious to the fact that the trip had descended into total chaos."
},
{
"start": 31.17,
"end": 31.53,
"text": " I've got you."
},
{
"start": 31.55,
"end": 32.09,
"text": "I've got Prince."
},
{
"start": 32.15,
"end": 33.97,
"text": "I've got Prince."
},
{
"start": 35.93,
"end": 41.66,
"text": "Concerned for the safety of the children, I was caught with them in the middle of a paparazzi scrum."
},
{
"start": 42.36,
"end": 43.98,
"text": "I've got Prince."
},
{
"start": 44.74,
"end": 45.28,
"text": "I've got Prince."
},
{
"start": 45.84,
"end": 46.54,
"text": "That's it, Prince."
},
{
"start": 46.64,
"end": 47.96,
"text": "I'll just stay there."
},
{
"start": 49.38,
"end": 55.31,
"text": "It was no kind of trip for two young children, and everybody could see it but Jackson himself."
},
{
"start": 75.69,
"end": 79.77,
"text": " It was hard to believe Jackson was the same man I'd met in Neverland."
},
{
"start": 80.65,
"end": 86.44,
"text": "The first opportunity to talk about his bizarre behaviour was later that evening at a charity auction."
},
{
"start": 88.17,
"end": 90.17,
"text": " What about the trip to the zoo today?"
},
{
"start": 90.44,
"end": 96.82,
"text": "I love going to the zoo, even though it was difficult, it was like pandemonium, but as long as I get to see the gorillas, I'm satisfied."
},
{
"start": 96.84,
"end": 97.89,
"text": "I love the gorillas."
},
{
"start": 98.13,
"end": 99.97,
"text": "Didn't Prince get poked in the eye?"
},
{
"start": 100.35,
"end": 101.29,
"text": "Did Prince get poked in the eye?"
},
{
"start": 101.35,
"end": 101.59,
"text": "No."
},
{
"start": 102.07,
"end": 102.67,
"text": "He was OK?"
},
{
"start": 102.77,
"end": 103.65,
"text": "He's OK, yeah."
},
{
"start": 104.54,
"end": 107.74,
"text": " The children were under enormous pressure with people all around."
},
{
"start": 107.86,
"end": 108.2,
"text": "Yeah."
},
{
"start": 108.6,
"end": 114.5,
"text": "But, I know, it's sad, but they were, the first day of birth, we had covered them."
},
{
"start": 114.56,
"end": 119.21,
"text": "There was like helicopters flying around the hospital and satellites for two blocks down the street."
},
{
"start": 119.87,
"end": 129.19,
"text": "But wouldn't it be easier for the bodyguards and for your nanny just to take the children to the zoo on their own rather than have to go through what they went through today?"
},
{
"start": 129.21,
"end": 131.77,
"text": "No, because I can't take that chance."
},
{
"start": 134.25,
"end": 136.64,
"text": " I'd rather it be my fault if something happens."
},
{
"start": 136.94,
"end": 137.24,
"text": "Really?"
},
{
"start": 137.72,
"end": 141.32,
"text": "So you wouldn't allow them to go with your bodyguards unless you were with them?"
},
{
"start": 141.34,
"end": 143.44,
"text": "With security, there's a lot of..."
},
{
"start": 144.08,
"end": 149.01,
"text": "I don't want to say the word, but it'd be hard, really walking the line, very delicate."
},
{
"start": 150.53,
"end": 152.27,
"text": "You've had a tough week this week, haven't you?"
},
{
"start": 152.29,
"end": 156.8,
"text": "Because the media have been accusing you of being irresponsible with your children."
},
{
"start": 157.61,
"end": 158.37,
"text": " The media's wrong."
},
{
"start": 158.95,
"end": 159.85,
"text": "I love my children."
},
{
"start": 159.97,
"end": 163.81,
"text": "I was holding my son tight and strong."
},
{
"start": 163.87,
"end": 165.59,
"text": "Why would I throw a paving of a balcony?"
},
{
"start": 165.81,
"end": 168.45,
"text": "That's the dumbest, stupidest story I've ever heard."
},
{
"start": 168.55,
"end": 169.44,
"text": "I love my children."
},
{
"start": 170.06,
"end": 171.46,
"text": "And they know I love them."
},
{
"start": 171.5,
"end": 175.4,
"text": "And two minutes before they saw the baby, Prince did the same thing."
},
{
"start": 175.42,
"end": 176.48,
"text": "I had them in my office."
},
{
"start": 176.66,
"end": 177.3,
"text": "And I've done it."
},
{
"start": 178.05,
"end": 179.91,
"text": " You know, but I got them strong."
},
{
"start": 179.93,
"end": 181.24,
"text": "Were you just overexcited?"
},
{
"start": 181.31,
"end": 181.66,
"text": "No."
},
{
"start": 181.96,
"end": 182.46,
"text": "What was it?"
},
{
"start": 182.48,
"end": 185.12,
"text": "They were chanting they want to see the baby, so I wanted to show them the baby."
},
{
"start": 185.16,
"end": 186.32,
"text": "I'm not going to let them fall."
},
{
"start": 186.36,
"end": 188.66,
"text": "But you didn't really show them the baby because the baby was covered."
},
{
"start": 188.68,
"end": 188.98,
"text": "Yes, they did."
},
{
"start": 189.0,
"end": 189.92,
"text": "They got to feel his spirit."
},
{
"start": 189.94,
"end": 190.52,
"text": "That's good enough."
},
{
"start": 190.54,
"end": 191.6,
"text": "And he was responding."
},
{
"start": 191.64,
"end": 192.94,
"text": "He started singing."
},
{
"start": 196.65,
"end": 203.56,
"text": "The consummate performer since childhood, Jackson was entirely unfazed by the day, and so the show went on."
},
{
"start": 215.28,
"end": 217.06,
"text": " He donated one of his jackets."
},
{
"start": 217.7,
"end": 220.4,
"text": "It was auctioned for 16,000 pounds."
},
{
"start": 227.47,
"end": 231.17,
"text": "And still the fans tried desperately hard to get near him."
},
{
"start": 233.37,
"end": 234.65,
"text": " Michael, I love you."
},
{
"start": 234.77,
"end": 236.59,
"text": "I love you Michael."
},
{
"start": 236.63,
"end": 238.73,
"text": "Can I have a hug please?"
},
{
"start": 239.37,
"end": 241.62,
"text": "Sure."
},
{
"start": 241.66,
"end": 243.06,
"text": "Please may I hug you?"
},
{
"start": 243.16,
"end": 244.12,
"text": "Okay."
},
{
"start": 244.24,
"end": 244.96,
"text": "I love you man."
},
{
"start": 245.02,
"end": 246.04,
"text": "I love you as well."
},
{
"start": 246.14,
"end": 248.42,
"text": "I love you."
},
{
"start": 248.44,
"end": 249.54,
"text": "Michael."
},
{
"start": 249.72,
"end": 251.31,
"text": "Hi Michael."
},
{
"start": 251.43,
"end": 252.59,
"text": "I'm the leader."
},
{
"start": 252.85,
"end": 254.57,
"text": "Germany loves you Michael."
},
{
"start": 254.59,
"end": 256.05,
"text": "I love Germany."
},
{
"start": 256.11,
"end": 257.05,
"text": "I really love you."
},
{
"start": 276.14,
"end": 277.8,
"text": " It was the final night in Berlin."
}
]
